      "writtenOn": "2026-02-06T23:24:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How do skills interact with extensions? At a glance, a lot of the functionality here feels like it belongs in an extension (since it could be applicable outside of this skill), but I have no idea if skills will properly use extensions or if there\u0027s a way to mark a dependency on an extension so we can guarantee that it\u0027s available when using the skill.",
